Z||000000||sjp777||04-23-2001||08:38 PM||||OK, I've been promising a how to article for this and I finally got something up. Not as complete as I would like it, but a good start. Check my website.<P>This is my new intake scoop, designed and fabricated by me. I think it looks much better than the Holley version, and due to the round shape and larger opening, I would bet it flows more air. What do you all think?<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1629836&a=12458590&p=47155596&Sequence=0&res=high">     <BR> <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1629836&a=12458590&p=47136150&Sequence=0&res=high">     <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1629836&a=12458590&p=47136104&Sequence=0&res=high">     <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1629836&a=12458590&p=47136160&Sequence=0&res=high">     <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1629836&a=12458590&p=47136161&Sequence=0&res=high">     <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1629836&a=12458590&p=47136159&Sequence=0&res=high">     <P><BR>------------------<BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/</A><P>[This message has been edited by sjp777 (edited 04-24-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by sjp777 (edited 05-12-2001).]||||reg||14
